# Markdown files that no longer need the document-deslop skill run on them.
#
# One entry per line: <status> <blob-sha> <path>.
#
#   checked   the skill ran, the faithful-reader check passed, and the diff
#             was reviewed by the user.
#   accepted  the user read the file and judged it clean. The skill never ran.
#
# The sha is `git hash-object <path>` as of that decision, so a path whose
# current sha no longer matches has been edited since and is due again.
#
# Absence means never deslopped. There is no false value. Files the skill
# must never run on are listed in .deslop-exempt instead.

checked  bf7290e1b51768f8e41255373bd833a21a9c1313 software-factory/factory-operations.md
checked  b8429d67b4b24358eef7eee57c714005d21f2bb0 standards/prose/conventions.md

